    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >~ Story ~</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mamizou Futatsuiwa, the boss of the haunted raccoon dogs, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >checks on the changes in the raccoon dogs under his command!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Mamizou is too busy to spend much time on this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to quickly find out the changes in a short period of time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a speedy mistake-finding game, a derivative of Touhou Project! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(this is fangame.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. Check the wrong parts compared to the sample!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The parts to be checked are roughly divided into three parts: head, upper waist, and lower waist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare with the sample and select \u201cOK\u201d for the correct part and \u201cNG\u201d for the wrong part!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various kinds of mistakes, such as the color of the parts, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the presence or absence of decorations, differences in the belongings, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them may be completely different from the sample...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Speed up the game by answering correctly in a row!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you answer 3 questions in a row correctly without making a mistake, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the game speed will increase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to check more raccoon dogs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. Various characters appear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters that will change are the well-known Touhou characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance through the stages, more characters will appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you know the characters well, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you may be able to recognize them without comparing them with the samples!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5. Finally</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy!!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >~ Story ~</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mamizou Futatsuiwa, the boss of the haunted raccoon dogs, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >checks on the changes in the raccoon dogs under his command!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Mamizou is too busy to spend much time on this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to quickly find out the changes in a short period of time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a speedy mistake-finding game, a derivative of Touhou Project! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(this is fangame.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. Check the wrong parts compared to the sample!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The parts to be checked are roughly divided into three parts: head, upper waist, and lower waist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare with the sample and select \u201cOK\u201d for the correct part and \u201cNG\u201d for the wrong part!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various kinds of mistakes, such as the color of the parts, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the presence or absence of decorations, differences in the belongings, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them may be completely different from the sample...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Speed up the game by answering correctly in a row!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you answer 3 questions in a row correctly without making a mistake, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the game speed will increase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to check more raccoon dogs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. Various characters appear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters that will change are the well-known Touhou characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance through the stages, more characters will appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you know the characters well, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you may be able to recognize them without comparing them with the samples!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5. Finally</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy!!</p>",
    "short_description": "Touhou Project's secondary Speedy Mistake-finding game!Check for errors in the content of the changes! The speed increases when you get consecutive correct answers!Let's check if the various Touhou characters are correct!",
